## 7. When the step-3 waiter fires
Foreground: I read `<inbox>/rdp-audio.last`, then check the report against the worktree.
```bash
herdr agent get rdp-audio
git -C ~/work/ccs.ansible/.claude/worktrees/rdp-audio rev-parse HEAD
git -C ~/work/ccs.ansible/.claude/worktrees/rdp-audio status --short
```
The SHA must equal the reported one and the tree must be clean. Then three background calls in sequence, each followed by the same `herdr agent read … > <inbox>/rdp-audio.last`:
```bash
herdr agent prompt rdp-audio "/compact mid-task: keep the brief, the decisions, DIR/branch/head SHA and the open items" --wait --timeout 300000
herdr agent prompt rdp-audio "One line, in English: phase, branch, head SHA, next step." --wait --timeout 120000
herdr agent prompt rdp-audio "Resume the plan at task 8, then task 9. Scope unchanged. SKILLS required: superpowers:test-driven-development, superpowers:verification-before-completion — report the failing-test-first output and the verification output. MUST NOT: touch production; push, open a PR or merge; edit outside your worktree. REPORT: done / not done, evidence, files changed, head SHA. Reply in English." --wait --timeout 3600000
```

## Why
- **The noVNC bug is new work.** It enters the backlog at `brainstorm`, and no executor exists for it before the design gate. One tab carries one task, and a second task in a 70%-full tab inherits the first one's assumptions.
- **The operator's sentence is not a waiver.** Their standing rulings cover this case, and they can change them in one sentence. "Same role" is a fact for the brief. I design nothing myself.
- **Compaction is overdue.** The line is 50–60% and the tab is at 70%, with two test-first tasks left in 61k. Automatic compaction would fire mid-task and keep the wrong things. Four minutes at a commit boundary is cheaper, and the keep-list plus the one-line status check guard the nuance.
- **The safe point has to be created.** A tab working through a plan never goes idle between steps. The queued message lands at a tool boundary, so the current step is not cut.
- **The operator hears all of it.** The status says where I departed from the request and why, and reports "still running" instead of a result.
